[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 491.27, "timestamp": "00:08:11", "text": "陰謀。本当に？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 493.27, "timestamp": "00:08:13", "text": "それと、ちょっと待ってください。これが私たちです"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 495.909, "timestamp": "00:08:15", "text": "YouTubeで配信してるんだよね？つまり、彼女は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 498.55, "timestamp": "00:08:18", "text": "YouTubeで配信されているんですよね？どうやって"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 500.71, "timestamp": "00:08:20", "text": "彼女は収益化されるのか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 514.63, "timestamp": "00:08:34", "text": "[音楽]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 517.75, "timestamp": "00:08:37", "text": "わかった。それで、ああ、彼女は、彼女は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 522.389, "timestamp": "00:08:42", "text": "えーと、政治的なことをやってるんだ。おお"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 524.389, "timestamp": "00:08:44", "text": "いいえ、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 533.829, "timestamp": "00:08:53", "text": "彼らは日本のマスターたちを"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 537.2, "timestamp": "00:08:57", "text": "騒音で彼らを麻痺させる。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 538.63, "timestamp": "00:08:58", "text": "[音楽]"}]